00:22:23.190 --> 00:22:25.820
We have to please our partners because
our.

00:22:25.820 --> 00:22:29.440
As this is Coursera specific now because
you wouldn't have to go to this way, but

00:22:29.440 --> 00:22:34.730
our niche in this market is aggregating
