the company.

00:24:39.630 --> 00:24:45.590
&gt;&gt; It's, there's, it's different, that's
for sure, but but as a general.

00:24:47.510 --> 00:24:52.130
As a general matter, there's a lot that's
in common in any leadership position, and,

00:24:52.130 --> 00:24:54.000
and I said it, you know,

00:24:54.000 --> 00:24:58.930
having a vision, communicating it clearly,
picking the right people,

00:24:58.930 --> 00:25:03.400
putting them in the right jobs, enabling
them, not micromanaging them.

00:25:03.400 --> 00:25:06.978
You know, those are all lessons that are
very very general.

00:25:06.978 --> 00:25:09.730
And and, and,

00:25:09.730 --> 00:25:14.130
you know, running Coursera's sort of more,
a little more, it's somewhere in between.

00:25:14.130 --> 00:25:16.900
It's sort of what, more like running the
