And 30 or 40 staff, so it, it course, a
little bit smaller than Coursera.

00:25:30.100 --> 00:25:31.940
But, and so, you know,

00:25:31.940 --> 00:25:34.630
you have all hands meetings, you deal with
the whole population.

00:25:34.630 --> 00:25:36.980
You didn't do that in a big organization
