00:25:40.300 --> 00:25:45.140
process and or, organize people, delegate
tasks to the right people.

00:25:45.140 --> 00:25:46.220
All that's the same.

00:25:46.220 --> 00:25:48.140
What's kind of different.

00:25:48.140 --> 00:25:50.370
Is the speed of the,

00:25:50.370 --> 00:25:55.250
of the required speed of decision making
in this in this internet environment.

00:25:55.250 --> 00:25:58.390
I mean, we're in a brand new start up
business were

00:25:58.390 --> 00:26:00.260
constantly testing and iterating.

00:26:00.260 --> 00:26:03.790
We have to do our product development
