00:26:28.610 --> 00:26:31.070
You know they're coming at you all the
time.

00:26:31.070 --> 00:26:32.220
And just as they are in the University.

00:26:32.220 --> 00:26:34.210
But in the University you know everybody's
used to.

00:26:34.210 --> 00:26:36.600
Oh let's talk about this for three months
before we decide.

00:26:36.600 --> 00:26:39.590
I mean it just th, there's not that sense
